'''Hoshi Grandmarnier''' (星 グランマニエ ''Hoshi Guranmanie'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Kishidan Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 3.4 Update|Version 3.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Hoshi Grandmarnier
|image = E 144.png
|appearance = [[Kishidan Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 460円 - 1,817円
}}

==Enemy==
An extremely weak enemy with low health and pathetic damage, but relatively high range. Like the other enemies in this collaboration event, using ranged attackers is the key to dealing with this enemy.

==Strategy==
He won't be a threat since he has low attack power, range, and health. Even at [[Super Clash!! Kishidan!!]], his extremely low attack power makes it so your attackers will take almost no damage from his attacks, or your meatshields. This combined with his long attack animation means you can just spam all your ranged attackers that you have until he is defeated.

